{
  "body0": "Red Vane Labor Combine hires from the same ration queue Veyra-Locke Concession polices. Helion Debt Synod and Ninth Ledger Office both want Danfeng's Flare II. Kestrel Free Compact disputes Veyra-Locke Concession's claim.",
