{
  "body0": "Pale Saint Wake keeps the receipts. Salt Wound Wake keeps the witnesses. Bone Lantern Order wants Salt Wound Wake to bleed first. One chair sits at the head of this table, and Carrion Synod and Crown of Dust Pact have stopped pretending they'd share it.",
